**🎯 Key Finding:**
CRITICAL REDUNDANCY: Scribe and Nexus vault both manage markdown notes/projects
→ Solution: Scribe uses Nexus vault by default (3 hours to implement)

**🔗 Integration Strategy:**
```
Layer 5: AI Brain    → NEXUS (Claude MCP)
Layer 4: Content     → SCRIBE (Editor for Nexus vault)
Layer 3: Workflow    → FLOW-CLI (ZSH commands)
Layer 2: State       → ATLAS (Engine)
Layer 1: Storage     → Filesystem/Obsidian/Zotero
```

